      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quilcene%2C_Washington",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Olympic Music Festival, held for 32 years at a turn‑of‑the‑century dairy farm, was voted “Best Classical Music Festival” by Seattle Weekly readers.",
